ve preview images from a video.</li><li>Selection of a video section for later download.</li></ul><p>The web interface is still under development and should not yet be treated as a finished automated video-management system.</p><h3>1.6 Planned Enhancements</h3><p>Future development includes more comprehensive download automation, duplicate-file handling, progress monitoring, and notifications to Apple devices when a session is complete.</p><p>One particularly important notification will remind the operator to turn off the motorcycle after downloading.</p><p>We also intend to investigate whether the Mini can send a command over Wi-Fi to pause recording on the F1. That capability has not yet been verified.</p><h3>1.7 A Note for Windows Users</h3><p>This manual documents the actual Mac-based implementation. It does not contain untested Windows instructions.</p><p>If you’re using a Windows computer, you can upload this manual to ChatGPT and ask it to adapt the procedure to your particular machine. Include the computer’s manufacturer, model, approximate age, and Windows version.</p><p><strong>A word of caution:</strong> ChatGPT helped create the system described in this manual. It also helped create several of the problems we encountered along the way.</p><p>Proceed accordingly.</p><hr>','import',strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%fZ','now'));
